[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990188827","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107744#issuecomment-2990188827","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107744","id":2990188827,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yOqkb","user":{"login":"etherealxx","id":64251396,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjUxMzk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64251396?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx","html_url":"https://github.com/etherealxx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etherealxx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T08:00:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T08:00:36Z","body":"Does this \"cancel\" the whole process (like reverting all the generated thumbnails) or just stopping/halting the proccess at the moment the button is pressed (the already generated thumbnails stays)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990188827/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990287831","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107744#issuecomment-2990287831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107744","id":2990287831,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yPCvX","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T08:36:54Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T08:36:54Z","body":"I'm not against adding a cancel button, but what's the point? If it retries making thumbnails on the next editor run or the next time there's a filesystem sync (focus change), that's going to be a horrible UX.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990287831/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990357739","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107744#issuecomment-2990357739","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107744","id":2990357739,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yPTzr","user":{"login":"HungryProton","id":52043844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQzODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52043844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton","html_url":"https://github.com/HungryProton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HungryProton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T09:00:55Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T09:03:26Z","body":"Then this button would make sense if there were a way to turn off the automatic thumbnail check on startup.\r\n\r\nSince that feature is purely cosmetic, (and the thumbnails are not even visible when using the file system in tree mode), it would be nice to be able to turn off the automatic scan on launch, considering how slow it is to scan for every md5sum of every files, even on a moderately large project. \r\n\r\nIt could become an on demand operation under `Project > Tools > Update project thumbnails`. Having up to date thumbnails is not something critical enough to slow down launch speed that much.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990357739/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990985255","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107744#issuecomment-2990985255","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107744","id":2990985255,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yRtAn","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T10:58:59Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T13:32:51Z","body":"Can be closed if there are no problems with PR #107757\r\n\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n\r\nI think we can just run it in the background. \r\nI don't see any differences in the `EditorResourcePreview::_iterate()` function.\r\n\r\n![Bildschirmfoto 2025-06-20 um 12 41 59](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df9fad4e-2532-413b-b27c-325ecca3788e)\r\n\r\nIn the Compatibility Renderer it is only executed via `st->add_idle_callback(&_idle_callback);`.\r\nI think this can be accelerated by checking how long an `_iterate()` took and, for example, executing multiple `_iterate()` within 20ms or so.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid EditorResourcePreview::start() {\r\n\tif (DisplayServer::get_singleton()->get_name() == \"headless\") {\r\n\t\treturn;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tif (can_run_on_thread()) {\r\n\t\tERR_FAIL_COND_MSG(thread.is_started(), \"Thread already started.\");\r\n\t\tprint_line(\"thread.start\");\r\n\t\tthread.start(_thread_func, this);\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\tSceneTree *st = Object::cast_to<SceneTree>(OS::get_singleton()->get_main_loop());\r\n\t\tERR_FAIL_NULL_MSG(st, \"Editor's MainLoop is not a SceneTree. This is a bug.\");\r\n\t\tprint_line(\"st->add_idle_callback\");\r\n\t\tst->add_idle_callback(&_idle_callback);\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990985255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993491563","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107744#issuecomment-2993491563","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107744","id":2993491563,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybQ5r","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T09:46:12Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T09:46:12Z","body":"Superseded by #107786 (for 4.5 - might still be relevant for a 4.6 version of the scene preview PR).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993491563/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993592976","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107744#issuecomment-2993592976","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107744","id":2993592976,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ybpqQ","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-21T13:48:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-21T13:53:15Z","body":"If it should be important later, without cancel button, run in background:\r\n\r\n> Fix `thumbnail_progress` slowdown by batching `_iterate()` calls.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/master...Alex2782:godot:add_cancel_thumbnail_progress\r\n\r\n\r\nI tested this code yesterday, reducing the `thumbnail_progress` from 3 minutes to under 2 seconds. \r\nI also cleared the cache (`.godot` and `user://`) beforehand, and the behavior was identical.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993592976/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]